+- pydantic 1.10 docs — Model Config (extra): https://pydantic.dev/docs/validation/1.10/usage/model_config/
+- FastAPI encoders.py — decimal_encoder / ENCODERS_BY_TYPE: https://github.com/fastapi/fastapi/blob/master/fastapi/encoders.py
